<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance Gaming started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alliance Gaming started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Alliance Gaming Corp with a buy rating and a 1998 price target of $7 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The shares were up 1/4 at 4-1/2.</p>
